{"unit_id":"imroc__dsh-project-prompt#card-zh","repo":"imroc/dsh-project-prompt","commit":"69d3ed221ceb079f7426a202723d12c15a55272f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-prompt 是 DSH 提示词插件：它按 Git remote、主仓库路径或工作目录前缀匹配本机规则，并将文本加入系统提示词段或首条上下文消息。它识别 linked worktree，可设置 section 顺序，并支持 cwd、model 模板变量。规则存放在 DSH_HOME/cordis.patch.yml，适合按项目添加个人或环境指引。需要 Node.js 18 以上，不需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:169-186","index.js:198-243","index.js:255-300","cordis.patch.yml:16-18"]}
{"unit_id":"imroc__dsh-project-prompt#card-en","repo":"imroc/dsh-project-prompt","commit":"69d3ed221ceb079f7426a202723d12c15a55272f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-project-prompt adds local prompt rules to DSH sessions matched by Git remote, repository path, or cwd prefix. It supports linked worktrees and inserts text as a system-prompt section or context message. Configure rules in DSH_HOME/cordis.patch.yml. Requires Node.js 18+; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:169-186","index.js:198-243","index.js:255-300","cordis.patch.yml:16-18"]}
