{"unit_id":"imroc__dsh-project-prompt#feature-1","repo":"imroc/dsh-project-prompt","commit":"69d3ed221ceb079f7426a202723d12c15a55272f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-prompt 的功能「项目规则匹配」：按 Git remote、主仓库路径或 cwd 前缀匹配配置规则；任一匹配键命中即可应用。规则在 agent 生命周期事件中按会话工作目录选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:159-186","index.js:255-262"]}
{"unit_id":"imroc__dsh-project-prompt#feature-2","repo":"imroc/dsh-project-prompt","commit":"69d3ed221ceb079f7426a202723d12c15a55272f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-prompt 的功能「工作树识别」：从 linked worktree 的 .git 指针解析主仓库，再读取其 origin 地址，使按仓库路径或 remote 配置的规则也能覆盖工作树及其子目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:87-114","index.js:121-138"]}
{"unit_id":"imroc__dsh-project-prompt#feature-3","repo":"imroc/dsh-project-prompt","commit":"69d3ed221ceb079f7426a202723d12c15a55272f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-prompt 的功能「双模式注入」：匹配后可将规则文本注册为 agent 的系统提示词 section，或构造成首条 user 上下文消息注入；section 支持 cwd 和 model 模板变量。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:189-210","index.js:264-289"]}
{"unit_id":"imroc__dsh-project-prompt#feature-4","repo":"imroc/dsh-project-prompt","commit":"69d3ed221ceb079f7426a202723d12c15a55272f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-prompt 的功能「规则加载校验」：插件加载时检查规则是否有非空文本和 path、repo、remote 匹配条件，并验证模式名称及 section 模板变量；不符合要求时直接抛出配置错误。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:198-210","index.js:221-243"]}
